<title>USA: ANB Corp ends stock repurchase program.</title>
<headline>ANB Corp ends stock repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANB Corp said Thursday it terminated a stock repurchase program in place since 1995.</p>
<p>In May 1995, the company announced a program to buy up to 200,000 shares of common stock. During the time the program was in place, it repurchased 162,302 shares.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
